.TH ODYSSEUS 1 "October 2026" "Odysseus 1.5.3" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
odysseus \- GTK4 file manager in the style of GNOME Files
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B odysseus
[\fIOPTION\fR...] [\fILOCATION\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Odysseus is a file manager that looks and behaves like GNOME Files (Nautilus),
with dual panel, column view, archives, PDF tools and more built in.
Each \fILOCATION\fR (folder, file or URI such as smb://) is opened in a tab;
a file is shown selected in its folder.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-w ", " \-\-new\-window
Open a new window.
.TP
.BR \-d ", " \-\-dual
Open in dual panel mode; with two locations, one on each side.
.TP
.BR \-s ", " \-\-search\-content
Search in the contents of the files of the given folder.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Print the version.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/odysseus/settings.json
Preferences.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR nautilus (1)
